  "label": "User projected onto the fashionable woman",
  "description": "The user is projected onto the visual material of the woman, as the meme uses her as the embodiment of the 'fashion forward!' concept. The text explicitly labels her as such, and her confident, stylish appearance invites the user to identify with or admire her fashion choices. There are no explicit deictic pronouns like 'me' or 'you', but the framing of the image and the text creates an implicit projection where the viewer sees themselves in her confidence and style.",
